+# Expensebook
+
+Standard-library-only CSV expense totals. CSV columns: `category,amount`.
+Amounts are signed decimals with at most two decimal places.
+
+Run: `python -m expensebook "expenses.csv"`
+
+Tests: `python -m unittest discover -s tests -v`
